\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 20002552 (AIM-PHYSICS-0060). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] American Institute of Mathematics, Variational Methods in Celestial Mechanics; notes by Kuo-Chang Chen, version 22 June 2003, source item 23.
\url{https://aimath.org/WWN/varcelest/varcelest.pdf}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:20002552}

